Three terminals is fine for six jobs, but nothing about the underlying idea actually requires naming workers by hand. Docker Compose can run several identical copies of one service definition and hand every copy the same command. Add a worker service to docker-compose.yml that builds from a small Dockerfile and runs worker.js unmodified:

```yaml
# add this service to docker-compose.yml
